## Interaction Model

```
Sidebar click "Design Audit"
  → nudimmudEngine.go('DESIGN_AUDIT')
  → mountModule('DESIGN_AUDIT', 'module-content')
  → <DesignAuditHUD /> mounts, screen = 'catalog'

Catalog:
  chip click → onSelect(category, value) → setConfig({...config, [category]: value})
  debug panel → JSON.stringify(config, null, 2), updates live
  "Continue" → disabled until all 6 fields set, then screen = 'confirm'

Confirm:
  "Edit" → screen = 'catalog' (config preserved, no reset)
  "Apply Design Language" → setConfig({...config, confirmed: true}), screen = 'hud'

HUD:
  mount → score meters animate scaleX(0 → score/100) staggered 100ms per section
  section header click → toggle collapsed (AnimatePresence height animation)
  inspector item hover → tooltip + --cyan-glow ring outline
  "Export Handoff JSON" → assemble NUDIMMUD_DESIGN_HANDOFF, Blob download .json
  "Reset" → screen = 'catalog', config reset to defaults
```

