## Risk Points

| Risk | Mitigation |
|------|-----------|
| `requestAnimationFrame` leak on unmount | Store frameId in `useRef`, cancel in `useEffect` cleanup |
| Canvas conflicts with NexusConstellation | Scoped `<canvas>` inside component DOM, `pointer-events: none`, `z-index: 0` |
| Framer `height: 'auto'` collapse flash | Wrap content in `overflow: hidden` container (NeuralForge pattern) |
| `prefers-reduced-motion` | `useReducedMotion()` from Framer; hide canvas, instant transitions |
| TypeScript strict mode | No `any` casts; mock data typed against interfaces from types.ts |
| nav-node click routing | `data-module="DESIGN_AUDIT"` must match the `mountModule` case key exactly |

